# The repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true and deployed to
# Linux. Git normalises text on commit either way, but these files are read by
# programs that treat a stray CR as content rather than whitespace — a CRLF
# Caddyfile or entrypoint script fails in ways whose error message never
# mentions line endings. Pin them.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Caddyfile       text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
